<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background-color: #f59e0b; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
      .content { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; }
      .countdown { background-color: #fef3c7; border: 2px solid #f59e0b; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
      .countdown-number { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; color: #d97706; }
      .button { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 32px; background-color: #4f46e5; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }
      .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1><%= @days_remaining == 1 ? "Your Trial Expires Tomorrow!" : "#{@days_remaining} Days Left on Your Trial" %></h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Hi <%= @user.first_name || @user.name %>,</h2>

        <div class="countdown">
          <div class="countdown-number"><%= @days_remaining %></div>
          <p><%= @days_remaining == 1 ? 'day' : 'days' %> remaining</p>
          <p>Trial expires: <%= @trial_ends_at.strftime('%d %B %Y') %></p>
        </div>

        <p>Your TEEEM trial for <strong><%= @tenant.name %></strong> is coming to an end. To keep using TEEEM and access all your data, upgrade to a paid plan before your trial expires.</p>

        <h3>What happens when your trial ends?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Your account will switch to read-only mode</li>
          <li>You can view existing data but cannot create or edit</li>
          <li>Your data will be preserved for 30 days</li>
          <li>Upgrade anytime to restore full access</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= @upgrade_url %>" class="button">Upgrade Now</a>
        </div>

        <p>Have questions about pricing or need more time to evaluate? Reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Tekna. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
